# Each step:  -- Step N: title, a sentence or two, then 1 to 4 checks:
#   [ ] file <path>                 the file is in the project
#   [ ] file <path> says "<text>"   the file has that exact text in it
#   [ ] run npm test -- <test file> the project's own tests pass
#   [ ] run npm run <script>        one of the project's npm scripts passes
#   [ ] ask <sentence>              Censai reads the helper's report against it
# A dot turns green only when censaiOS has checked it.
